                                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">4. Mock Device Generation</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-4">
                                     An experimental "mock stent" lattice generated to validate the deployment logic. Designed to be fitted across the parent vessel, this parametric model tests the algorithm's ability to adapt rigid mesh structures to biological curvature.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

