                                <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-4">
                                    Current state of the stent fitting algorithm (implementing the Paliwal VSW method). The incomplete deployment highlights the immense computational complexity of simulating physics-based wall apposition and collision detection within the project's timeframe.
                                </p>
